{"schema":"mcpgit.table-batch-transaction.v1","transaction_id":"7fb2571c-c987-5a67-987a-8c7b8ae6a55b","idempotency_key":"7fb2571c-c987-5a67-987a-8c7b8ae6a55b","actor":{"kind":"github-action","repository":"yxsicd/agentlabrelease","runId":"36380341869"},"recorded_at_unix_ms":1790572086222,"tables":[{"path":"program_facts","operations":[{"op":"insert","operation_id":"39baa9fe-66ef-5b8a-8f9a-9df20257e8eb","key":"agent-analysis-iap-jws-payload-type-contract","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-iap-jws-payload-type-contract","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"f779cc53db0694ab51696ac6d6bd4664f47264437ac709880265ede6463bcdea"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"f642135ebacc3330ff25b59ce9e71e360e7dfd7c","path":"entry/src/main/ets/common/IapDataModel.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"7f28939c1c502b6dec8c37882316605128f8555d","path":"entry/src/main/ets/pages/SubscriptionsPage.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"a2f6eed04623eb53cd541db588674daa4fe6ad31","path":"entry/src/main/ets/common/JWSUtil.ets"}],"id":"agent-analysis-iap-jws-payload-type-contract","interpretation":"IapDataModel.ets is a 52-line, logic-free declaration module that fixes the type vocabulary of the app's IAP contract. It declares PurchaseData (the JWS envelope with optional jwsPurchaseOrder/jwsSubscriptionStatus), PurchaseOrderPayload (purchase fields incl. finishStatus), the subscription chain SubGroupStatusPayload -> SubscriptionStatus -> optional lastPurchaseOrder/renewalInfo, and string-valued enums FinishStatus ('1'/'2') and SubStatus ('1','2','3','5') mirroring IAP status codes; SubRenewalInfo stays module-private. Maintenance contract: field names, optionality, and enum values are load-bearing. Pages JSON.parse IAPKit strings (after JWSUtil.decodeJwsObj base64url decoding) and blind-cast to these interfaces with no runtime validation, so renaming a field or changing an enum value silently changes consumer branching (finishStatus !== FINISHED gates finishPurchase; status === ACTIVE gates product display) instead of failing loudly. Any edit must stay in sync with IAPKit server payload shapes and all four importing pages at once, and new IAP fields belong here rather than inline in pages.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["No IAPKit server payload sample or schema exists in the repository, so the claim that the interface field names and enum string values exactly match live IAP JWS payloads is inferred from consumer usage and the sample readme, not verified against the service.","The four page consumers typecast JSON.parse results to these interfaces with 'as'; whether ArkTS type checking or any runtime guard ever rejects mismatched payload shapes was not tested, as no build, compiler run, or device execution was performed.","Fields such as SubGroupStatusPayload.environment, applicationId, packageName, and historySubscriptionStatusList appear unconsumed in the current pages; whether they are reserved for future IAP features or dead declarations is unproved.","SubscriptionsPage comments mention signature verification of jwsSubscriptionStatus, but JWSUtil.decodeJwsObj only base64url-decodes; whether cryptographic JWS verification happens elsewhere is not established by this scope."],"repositoryId":"harmony-iap-client","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-harmony-iap-client-entry-src-main-ets-common-iapdatamodel-ets"],"sourceRevision":"59260e2b0f9663be2d35288f4f339b8ce60ae5a3"},"payloadSha256":"9673964c8c11b8efc84bd74ae33cba4a5c967020b3038d5e06768e921d14db41","repositoryId":"harmony-iap-client","sourceRevision":"59260e2b0f9663be2d35288f4f339b8ce60ae5a3"}}],"results":[{"operation_id":"39baa9fe-66ef-5b8a-8f9a-9df20257e8eb","op":"insert","key":"agent-analysis-iap-jws-payload-type-contract","previous_row_version":null,"row_version":1,"deleted":false}]},{"path":"maintainer_skill_refresh_rounds","operations":[{"op":"insert","operation_id":"bc66